5963	AssessmentItemAPIPResponseProcessingXML	AssessmentItemAPIPResponseProcessingXML	Response processing is the process by which the Delivery Engine assigns outcomes based on the learner's responses. The outcomes may be used to provide feedback to the learner Feedback is either provided immediately following the end of the learner's attempt or it is provided at some later time, perhaps as part of a summary report on the item session. The XML from the IMS Global APIP Specification would be included.	\N	4	string	\N	\N	\N	CEDS v14	property: P001132\ntextFormat: Alphanumeric	\N	\N	\N	\N	LIF	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	Public	f	f
